{"id":"n67860-1-8","stage":2,"title":"왼발 · 左脚","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67860-1-8-1","ko":"죄송하지만 지금 제 왼발을 밟고 있으신데요.","zh":"不好意思，您现在正踩着我的左脚呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왼발을","meaning":"左脚","explanation":"왼발：左脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"왼발","audio":"/audio/a447666fdceda560ef17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67860","senseId":"1","lemma":"왼발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밟고","meaning":"踩","explanation":"밟다：踩；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"밟다","audio":"/audio/cc2cc4cec780cfa623c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64728","senseId":"1","lemma":"밟다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으신데요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.m